# AI Interior Designer Platform

Build a premium AI-powered interior design platform using Astro, Tailwind CSS v4, TypeScript, and modern web standards. Follow Astro best practices, Tailwind v4 conventions, and the project's DESIGN.md design system.

The design quality should feel comparable to Vercel, Linear, Apple, Notion, and Airbnb—minimal, elegant, fast, highly polished, and conversion-focused.

## Core Vision

Do NOT build another AI image generator.

Build an **AI Interior Designer**.

Most competitors generate pretty room images. This platform should help users:

* Understand what's wrong with their room
* Receive professional design feedback
* Generate improved room concepts
* Estimate budgets
* Create shopping plans
* Improve layouts
* Make real-world design decisions

The user should feel like they hired a professional interior designer, not used an image generation tool.

