# AI Design Consultant

This is the main differentiator.

After every generation provide:

### Design Summary

Explain:

* Why changes were made
* Why colors were chosen
* Why furniture was repositioned
* How the room functionality improved

The explanation should sound like a professional designer.

---

### Improvement Report

Example:

Current Room Score: 78

New Room Score: 93

Improvements:

✓ Better lighting

✓ Improved furniture flow

✓ More cohesive color palette

✓ Better visual hierarchy

✓ Increased perceived room size

